def event_review_done_teams_ready: "- The two teams for ticket \(.ticket // "unknown") finished independently, were reviewed, and passed checks. \($User) requested two results to choose between. Ask for approval ONCE with both PRs in the same command, under rule 4: what each did, differences for the user, each team’s captures, and your recommendation. Tell the user to write “Team 1” or “Team 2” on the ticket and move the card to the approval status. Script output, quoted:\n    | \(.text | gsub("\n"; " "))";
